  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Korada Tarakesh Aliastarak vs The State Of Andhra Pradesh on 13 November, 2019 Hon'Ble Sri Justice D.V.S.S.Somayajulu Criminal Petition No.6581 of 2019 Order:",
    "facts": "1. This Criminal Petition is filed by the petitioner / Accused No.2 under section 482 of the Code of Criminal Procedure to quash the proceedings against the petitioner, in FIR No.159 of 2018, on the file of the Station House Officer, Tekkali Police Station, Srikakulam District. The alleged offences against the petitioner are under sections 188, 270, 272, 273 of IPC and Sections 58, 59, 63 of Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006 and Section 20(2) Cigarettes and Other Tobacco Products (Prohibition of Advertisement and Regulation of Trade and Commerce, Production, Supply and Distribution) Act, 2003.",
    "arguments": "3. Learned counsel for the petitioner submits that in a similar case, this Court, by virtue of common order in Criminal Petition Nos.3731 of 2018 and batch, [LEAKAGE_MASK] the proceedings against the petitioners therein by considering that transportation of Gutka is not attracted by the offences alleged under Sections 188, 270 and 273 of IPC and FSS Act.",
    "petitioner_arguments": "3. Learned counsel for the petitioner submits that in a similar case, this Court, by virtue of common order in Criminal Petition Nos.3731 of 2018 and batch, [LEAKAGE_MASK] the proceedings against the petitioners therein by considering that transportation of Gutka is not attracted by the offences alleged under Sections 188, 270 and 273 of IPC and FSS Act.",
    "respondent_arguments": "",
    "other_lawyer_arguments": ""
